  "body": "## Changes\r\n\r\n* fix: update webpki crates to distrust compromised eMudhra certs (#1374)\r\n\r\n## Install\r\n\r\nRun `dprint upgrade` or see https://dprint.dev/install/\r\n\r\n## Verification\r\n\r\nThese artifacts have [build provenance attestations](https://docs.github.com/en/actions/security-for-github-actions/using-artifact-attestations/using-artifact-attestations-to-establish-provenance-for-builds).\r\nVerify a download with the [GitHub CLI](https://cli.github.com/):\r\n\r\n```shell\r\ngh attestation verify dprint-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.zip --repo dprint/dprint\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Checksums\r\n\r\n|Artifact|SHA-256 Checksum|\r\n|:--|:--|\r\n|dprint-x86_64-apple-darwin.zip|8a6f9d9e75e0379fb1b7fbc4a4528d33f72e050075bba7b20445be975a6d3273|\r\n|dprint-aarch64-apple-darwin.zip|d2a6e67e6aa308ed13d09627e8a8e8fe2cd3f62aeb406fe653d59bcec2c25c47|\r\n|dprint-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.zip|52f59def557bdab65744d2b0cd23585843b8158d2427f7a671c35bdd080b38d0|\r\n|dprint-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc-installer.exe|c33aa49fb5beda929c7129caf83f7c29302376e65845f03da9eec504210846e5|\r\n|dprint-aarch64-pc-windows-msvc.zip|9ac56dff1efd7aee00604bfbc19c979a600d7387365ed2013dafee33e8081c4f|\r\n|dprint-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.zip|9c2e00cd256dfa2c03a7f568ff08d8277abc5788c7f39fcd9ef325c4642cb4b4|\r\n|dprint-x86_64-unknown-linux-musl.zip|aad2ee102014c563112dcdad65e131dbcfe123355ef948ae91d806e833cdbf40|\r\n|dprint-aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu.zip|5d83774c7546bd7a223f243a17e7851a75b8315899d2a42268e40ebbae66c69b|\r\n|dprint-aarch64-unknown-linux-musl.zip|c8826c0b72fc0e1655404bf91fc29f821c01436e53152788e417df13a40d0671|\r\n|dprint-riscv64gc-unknown-linux-gnu.zip|4ad47f90731653e801dfacdc8a71054b8ca5ca7714fe6ac280b46d3c7e1d2ad6|\r\n|dprint-riscv64gc-unknown-linux-musl.zip|fb94e027362db09f5c257714446ef1b62bb1ecda851c8137616dc75ffd75bc01|\r\n|dprint-s390x-unknown-linux-gnu.zip|6c7f10fe58311f4a7ee3e754c1259b8ed694738df32ec25757290af1804ed169|\r\n|dprint-loongarch64-unknown-linux-gnu.zip|8a0c9a1a8558